# runtime user data lives under ~/.claude/oriel/, never in the repo
*.bak

# Agent-workflow configuration: how the private tracker is laid out, which triage
# label strings are used, where the domain docs live. It describes the working
# process, not Oriel, and it belongs with .scratch/ on the private side of the line
# ADR 0012 draws. Kept on disk — CLAUDE.md still points at it and it still works
# locally — but untracked, so it cannot be published by accident.
docs/agents/

